rbon sticks\n- nearby pocket residues and coordinate-derived dashed distance measurements\n- score/status fields from `summary_wide.csv`\n\n## Top pose: reflig\n\n**Primary ranking score:** -6.86\n\n## Computed contacts\n\n### Distance and interaction color legend\n\n- **hydrogen bond**: blue dashed line (#2563EB)\n- **hydrophobic contact**: ochre / orange dashed line (#CA8A04)\n- Residue side chains and residue labels use blue styling; dashed measurement line color is the interaction type.\n- If a contact cannot be typed conservatively, it remains `generic_contact`.\n\n### Contacts in this scene\n\n- **TYR689**: `hydrogen_bond` (hydrogen bond), OH to N3 = 3.58 Å\n- **LEU595**: `hydrophobic` (hydrophobic contact), CD2 to C2 = 3.24 Å\n- **VAL640**: `hydrophobic` (hydrophobic contact), CG2 to C12 = 3.55 Å\n- **PRO694**: `hydrophobic` (hydrophobic contact), CD to C22 = 3.61 Å\n- **VAL697**: `hydrophobic` (hydrophobic contact), CG1 to C19 = 3.69 Å\n- **LEU741**: `hydrophobic` (hydrophobic contact), CD1 to C12 = 4 Å\n\nDashed measurements are computed directly from the input coordinates. Typed interactions use conservative atom/residue rules; uncertain contacts remain generic.\n\n\n| Rank | Ligand | Primary score | Status notes |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 1 | lig2 | -9.05 | gnina_status=ok; smina_status=ok; matcha_status=not_run; boltz_status=ok |\n| 2 | lig3 | -8.93 | gnina_status=ok; smina_status=ok; matcha_status=not_run; boltz_status=ok |\n| 3 | lig1 | -8.1 | gnina_status=ok; smina_status=ok; matcha_status=not_run; boltz_status=ok |\n| 4 | reflig | -6.86 | gnina_status=ok; smina_status=ok; matcha_status=not_run; boltz_status=ok |\n","linger_duration_ms":8000,"transition_duration_ms":1000}},{"root":{"kind":"root","children":[{"kind":"download","params":{"url":"Receptor_chain_A.pdb"},"children":[{"kind":"parse","params":{"format":"pdb"},"children":[{"kind":"structure","params":{"type":"model"},"children":[{"kind":"component","params":{"selector":"polymer"},"children":[{"